graph TD
    %% Pheromone Detection
    A[Pheromone α-factor or a-factor] --> B{OR: Which<br/>Receptor?}
    B -->|MATa cells| C[Ste2 GPCR binds α-factor]
    B -->|MATα cells| D[Ste3 GPCR binds a-factor]
    
    C --> E[Ste2 Conformational Change]
    D --> E
    
    %% G Protein Activation
    E --> F[Gpa1-GDP Gβγ Heterotrimer]
    F --> G[GEF Activity]
    G --> H[Gpa1-GTP Formation]
    H --> I[G Protein Dissociation]
    I --> J[\Gpa1-GTP Inactive/]
    I --> K[Gβγ Ste4/Ste18 Active]
    
    %% Scaffold Recruitment
    K --> L[Ste5 Scaffold Recruitment]
    L --> M{AND: Ste5 + Gβγ<br/>Membrane?}
    M -->|No| N[No Signaling]
    M -->|Yes| O[Ste5 Membrane-Bound]
    
    %% MAPKKK Layer
    O --> P[Ste11 MAPKKK Recruitment]
    P --> Q{AND: Ste11 + Ste5<br/>+ Ste50?}
    Q -->|No| N
    Q -->|Yes| R[Ste11 Complex]
    
    R --> S[Ste20 PAK Kinase]
    S --> T[Ste20 Phosphorylates Ste11]
    T --> U[Ste11 Active]
    
    %% MAPKK Layer
    U --> V[Ste7 MAPKK on Ste5]
    V --> W{AND: Ste7 + Ste5<br/>Scaffold?}
    W -->|No| N
    W -->|Yes| X[Ste11 Phosphorylates Ste7]
    
    X --> Y[Ste7 Activated]
    
    %% MAPK Layer
    Y --> Z{OR: Which<br/>MAPK?}
    Z -->|Fus3 - Mating| AA[Fus3 MAPK]
    Z -->|Kss1 - Invasion| AB[Kss1 MAPK]
    
    AA --> AC[Ste7 Phosphorylates Fus3]
    AC --> AD[Fus3 Dual Phosphorylation]
    AD --> AE[Fus3-PP Active]
    
    %% Fus3 Substrates
    AE --> AF{OR: Which<br/>Substrate?}
    AF -->|Ste12| AG[Ste12 Transcription Factor]
    AF -->|Far1| AH[/Far1 CDK Inhibitor/]
    AF -->|Ste5| AI[Ste5 Feedback]
    AF -->|Msg5| AJ[/Msg5 Phosphatase/]
    
    %% Transcriptional Response
    AG --> AK{AND: Ste12<br/>AND Dig1/2 Relief?}
    AK -->|No| AL[\Repressed/]
    AK -->|Yes| AM[Dig1/2 Phosphorylated]
    
    AM --> AN[Dig1/2 Release]
    AN --> AO[Ste12 Active]
    AO --> AP[Ste12 Binds PRE Elements]
    
    AP --> AQ{OR: Which<br/>Mating Gene?}
    AQ -->|FUS1| AR[FUS1 Cell Fusion]
    AQ -->|FUS2| AS[FUS2 Cell Fusion]
    AQ -->|AGA1/2| AT(\1)
    AQ -->|FAR1| AU[FAR1 G1 Arrest]
    AQ -->|FIG1| AV[FIG1 Projection]
    
    %% Cell Cycle Arrest
    AH --> AW[Far1 Accumulation]
    AW --> AX{AND: Far1 + Cdc28-Cln?}
    AX -->|No| AY[Cell Cycle Continues]
    AX -->|Yes| AZ[\Cdc28-Cln Inhibited/]
    
    AZ --> BA[G1 Arrest]
    BA --> BB[Polarized Growth]
    BB --> BC[Shmoo Formation]
    
    %% Morphological Changes
    BC --> BD{AND: Actin<br/>Polarization?}
    BD -->|No| BE[No Projection]
    BD -->|Yes| BF[Actin Cables to Tip]
    BF --> BG[Bni1 Formin]
    BG --> BH[Projection Growth]
    
    %% Cell Fusion Preparation
    AR --> BI[Fus1 Membrane Fusion Protein]
    AS --> BI
    AT --> BJ[Agglutinin Cell Adhesion]
    BJ --> BK[Partner Cell Contact]
    
    BK --> BL{AND: Both Cells<br/>Shmoo?}
    BL -->|No| BM[Mating Fails]
    BL -->|Yes| BN[Cell Fusion Initiation]
    
    %% Cell Wall Degradation
    BN --> BO[/Local Wall Degradation/]
    BO --> BP{AND: Fus1 + Fus2<br/>Present?}
    BP -->|No| BM
    BP -->|Yes| BQ[Membrane Fusion]
    
    BQ --> BR[Cytoplasm Mixing]
    BR --> BS[Nuclear Migration]
    BS --> BT(\1)
    BT --> BU([Diploid Zygote])
    
    %% Negative Feedback
    AI --> BV[Ste5 Phosphorylation]
    BV --> BW[Ste5 Membrane Release]
    BW --> BX[Signaling Attenuation]
    
    AJ --> BY[Msg5 Dephosphorylates Fus3]
    BY --> BZ[Fus3 Inactivation]
    
